# 换行与二进制文件
* text=auto eol=lf

# APK、图片、字体都是二进制，不要让 Git 去改
*.apk   binary
*.png   binary
*.jpg   binary
*.jpeg  binary
*.webp  binary
*.ttf   binary
*.jar   binary
*.zip   binary

# 文档保持原样
*.md    text
*.ps1   text
*.js    text
*.css   text
*.html  text
*.java  text
*.xml   text

# 让 GitHub 统计语言时不要把网页层算成主要语言
android/assets/www/js/*.js linguist-language=JavaScript
